{"3957860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "6 rooms", "steam_appid": 3957860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the Time Loop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A communal apartment. A long corridor. 6 doors. And no way out. You're stuck in a nightmarish repeat, from which there seems to be no escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there are rules, and you must understand them:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Explore rooms full of puzzles and Soviet ambiance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/extras/5b4350d2143996731316790efc836136.avif?t=1769319490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/extras_big/5b4350d2143996731316790efc836136.webp?t=1769319490 width=1560 height=305 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Watch for anomalies. Does something seem strange? Go back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/extras/0a309a0eb146ededcc3a7c6e60854299.avif?t=1769319490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/extras_big/0a309a0eb146ededcc3a7c6e60854299.webp?t=1769319490 width=1560 height=305 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Analyze the behavior of the clock in the kitchen. It is your main guide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/extras/0d00b72647c385b19fabca586a2f685f.avif?t=1769319490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/extras_big/0d00b72647c385b19fabca586a2f685f.webp?t=1769319490 width=1560 height=305 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.Act! Interact with dozens of objects in search of answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/extras/feb9923470fa07029abb1f24e087b6e6.avif?t=1769319490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/extras_big/feb9923470fa07029abb1f24e087b6e6.webp?t=1769319490 width=1560 height=305 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality is cracked here. Your weapon is not strength, but attention. Every pass through the corridor is a new attempt, a new chance to notice what was missed. A detailed world, created in Unreal Engine 5, is waiting for you to study it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not horror. It is a ghostly nostalgia for a place that no longer exists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to piece your memory back together and find the exit to the real world?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the Time Loop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A communal apartment. A long corridor. 6 doors. And no way out. You're stuck in a nightmarish repeat, from which there seems to be no escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there are rules, and you must understand them:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Explore rooms full of puzzles and Soviet ambiance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/extras/5b4350d2143996731316790efc836136.avif?t=1769319490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/extras_big/5b4350d2143996731316790efc836136.webp?t=1769319490 width=1560 height=305 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Watch for anomalies. Does something seem strange? Go back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/extras/0a309a0eb146ededcc3a7c6e60854299.avif?t=1769319490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/extras_big/0a309a0eb146ededcc3a7c6e60854299.webp?t=1769319490 width=1560 height=305 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Analyze the behavior of the clock in the kitchen. It is your main guide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/extras/0d00b72647c385b19fabca586a2f685f.avif?t=1769319490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/extras_big/0d00b72647c385b19fabca586a2f685f.webp?t=1769319490 width=1560 height=305 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.Act! Interact with dozens of objects in search of answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/extras/feb9923470fa07029abb1f24e087b6e6.avif?t=1769319490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/extras_big/feb9923470fa07029abb1f24e087b6e6.webp?t=1769319490 width=1560 height=305 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality is cracked here. Your weapon is not strength, but attention. Every pass through the corridor is a new attempt, a new chance to notice what was missed. A detailed world, created in Unreal Engine 5, is waiting for you to study it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not horror. It is a ghostly nostalgia for a place that no longer exists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to piece your memory back together and find the exit to the real world?</p>", "short_description": "6 Rooms - Find a way to get out of the endless Soviet communal apartment, look for clues, watch out for anomalies.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Russian, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/8b9398377cf266d07a5958175115d6f045e9725c/header.jpg?t=1769319490", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/e3133970b8ec684b5e9b14008cbc386fab8a8c4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769319490", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/e3133970b8ec684b5e9b14008cbc386fab8a8c4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769319490", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["UUE"], "publishers": ["UUE"], "price_overview"